  "content": "\n\nBetter Zombie Horses 修复了一件非常简单的事：<em>僵尸马完全毫无用处。</em>\n\n有了这个模组，<strong>马</strong>再也不安全了！<strong>僵尸</strong>现在可以<b>攻击并杀死马</b>，将它们变成<strong>僵尸马。</strong>\n\n<img width = 500 alt=\"僵尸攻击马\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oXis2M34/images/e9cbdc4b391e7f8bbcf360178954b17394b8a8f4_350.webp\">\n\n<hr>\n<br><br>\n\n但这还不是全部：<b>僵尸马</b>实际上可以被<strong>僵尸骑乘！</strong>\n所以，一定要看好你的忠实坐骑，否则你可能会迎面撞上正在向你冲锋的<b>不死骑兵</b>。\n\n \n<img width = 500 alt=\"僵尸可以骑乘僵尸马\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oXis2M34/images/b5510c187fe72d94fd8c4005ee850a12b395f1e5.png\">\n\n<hr>\n<br><br>\n\n如果你心爱的马被感染了，<b>别慌</b>——<strong>你可以治愈它</strong>，就像治疗村民一样，只需使用<strong>虚弱药水</strong>和<strong>金苹果。</strong>\n\n\n<img width = 500 alt=\"治愈僵尸马\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oXis2M34/images/7ac1bc7d6d6707ebb420067e0981bbfb0e99c609.png\">\n\n<hr>\n<br><br>\n\n \n<br>\n\n[CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-zombie-horses)\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/eFjWWvNphY\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ITIIVc1.jpeg\" alt=\"加入 Discord 频道\" width=\"358\"></a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/boboMCmods\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EGs51Y.png\" alt=\"Patreon 赞助支持我\" width=\"360\"></a>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bo_bo\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J5FW8zh.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi 捐赠链接\" width=\"366\"></a>",
